@HybridCache.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5086

### List products (first call: cache miss, ~50 ms simulated DB latency)
GET {{HybridCache.Api_HostAddress}}/products
Accept: application/json

### List products again (L1 hit)
GET {{HybridCache.Api_HostAddress}}/products
Accept: application/json

### Get one product
GET {{HybridCache.Api_HostAddress}}/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Create (invalidates the list)
POST {{HybridCache.Api_HostAddress}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Monitor", "category": "Electronics", "price": 399.99 }

### Update (invalidates the item and the list)
PUT {{HybridCache.Api_HostAddress}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Gaming Laptop", "category": "Electronics", "price": 1499.99 }

### Delete
DELETE {{HybridCache.Api_HostAddress}}/products/2
